 e
DTSTAMP:20250313T143655Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>Join Us!&#160\; Our Thrive sessions will be a space for 
 LGBTQ+ Elders (age 55+) to share a meal with peers and engage in an educ
 ational or wellness-focused workshop.&#160\; For more information\, plea
 se contact Luna Britt at <a href="mailto:lbritt@blueridgepride.org" targ
 et="_blank" rel="noopener">lbritt@blueridgepride.org</a>.&#160\; &#160\;
 
CATEGORIES:Age Friendly
